<p>I like it. Are you implying that the main reason it's so hard to destroy is actually sabotage by the lower ranks? Haha. Very well written with all the lifelike detail.</p>
<p>I didn't mind the crosslinks since I hadn't read either of those before and they were just my cup of tea.</p>
<p>I do agree about some of the neutralization methods mentioned. With the amount of trouble this thing could cause if it wanted to, and its only semi-friendly air, the O5 Council bringing out the big guns to stop it seems reasonable, but you're mentioning some things there that I don't think are supposed to be common knowledge in the Foundation, in an entry that we know for SURE is accessible to Level 1 researchers and upwards! If anywhere, maybe they could go in the Level 4 note.</p>

